### 1. Add a book
POST http://localhost:5000/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Little Prince",
  "author": "Antoine de Saint-Exupery",
  "category": "Fiction",
  "image": "https://placehold.co/400x600",
  "description": "A short story about a young prince who travels between planets.",
  "totalCopies": 3,
  "userName": "Test User",
  "userEmail": "test@example.com"
}

### 2. Get all books
GET http://localhost:5000/books

### 3. Update (replace PASTE_ID with the _id from step 2)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/books/6aec9d203c35a83189dc305e
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Little Prince (Updated)",
  "totalCopies": 5
}

### 4. Delete (replace PASTE_ID)
DELETE http://localhost:5000/books/6aec9bd93c35a83189dc305d

